+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use an LRU (Least Recently Used) eviction policy with a cache time-to-live (TTL) of 300 seconds. The rationale recorded for this decision is operational simplicity: LRU is easier to reason about and easier to tune in production without additional instrumentation, and this was judged to outweigh the potential hit-rate gains of a frequency-based approach.
